00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:01.110
But one of the other things that I like

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:04.490
about Rank Choice Voting is
that we know that it works,

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:07.760
because it's been used
for over a hundred years

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:10.130
in Australia, for a
hundred years in Ireland,

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:14.160
many other countries
around the world use it.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:17.737
We know that it works
because all those countries

00:08:17.737 --> 00:08:20.530
have I've been successful
thriving democracies,

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:23.623
Australia has a century
of moderate politics.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:26.680
We know that it's widely recommended

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:30.880
by election experts who have studied

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:32.270
all of these voting systems,

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:36.820
and it's particularly
recommended in divided

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.970
and pluralistic societies
in which coalition building

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:43.020
is a especially important.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:46.000
And that's because we know,
again, from a hundred years

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.540
of experience that it
encourages compromise,

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:53.010
and coalition building in politics.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:55.180
And I think most importantly,

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:58.340
this is gonna be I think,
a a point of contention

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:00.191
in this debate, is that I think it makes

00:09:00.191 --> 00:09:05.191
the most realistic
assumptions about how voters,

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:09.880
campaigns, and parties will behave.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.940
It assumes that there
is going to be a level

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.900
of strategic voting,

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:18.290
and what makes Rank
Choice Voting work well is

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:21.380
that it's really a hard system to game.

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:25.440
It encourages people to vote
their sincere preferences,

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:30.280
because there's no real
benefit in not doing so.

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:34.550
And I think that is incredibly important.

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:39.550
So, I think it aligns
the incentives properly.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:43.283
It has again, and I think
this is really important,

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:48.510
we have lots and lots of
evidence that it works.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:50.950
It's just doesn't have to
