00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:53.320
We can go to the record.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:57.770
And I think, again, it makes realistic

00:09:57.770 --> 00:09:59.680
and reasonable assumptions about

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.600
how people are gonna behave,

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:06.600
