00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:37.810
So, when we're talking
about Approval Voting,

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:41.720
I think this explanation
is gonna be pretty simple.

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:44.510
Approval voting is simply
